+A visit's scientific fields include observation date, observer list, species cover estimates, and notes. Each revision carries the complete set of those fields; the record store does not combine field values from different revisions. The plot reference is part of the complete visit snapshot. The record store validates that a plot reference resolves in the catalog, including archived plots, but does not interpret the scientific content of a revision.
 
